<title>VENEZUELA: Peru tenders to buy May gas oil - Petroperu.</title>
<headline>Peru tenders to buy May gas oil - Petroperu.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's state oil company Petroperu issued a tender to buy one 200,000-barrel cargo of gas oil for delivery at the end of May, a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The official said the gas oil required was the usual Peruvian quality with 45 minimum cetane and 0.5-1.0 percent sulphur for delivery during May 28-31.</p>
<p>((-- Tom Ashby, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2611))</p>
